<section class="wrap prose">
  <h2>What we make</h2>
  <p>We design a small range of tents, sleeping bags, packs and layers. Each product goes through a full season of field testing before it reaches the shop. Fewer products means we can afford to get every seam right.</p>
  <h2>How we test</h2>
  <p>Prototypes spend months in the mountains of Norway, the Cascades and the Lake District. Testers log every night out, every failure and every fix. Nothing ships until it survives a winter.</p>
  <h2>Shipping</h2>
  <p>Orders over $150 ship free. Standard delivery takes 3–5 business days, express arrives in 1–2. You'll get a tracking link as soon as your parcel leaves the warehouse.</p>
